WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Which one you choosing?
The banana pudding cookie,

00:03.500 --> 00:07.000
the banana pudding cup,
or the banana pudding cone?

00:07.000 --> 00:10.500
Which one are you choosing?
We got options over here, baby.

00:10.500 --> 00:14.000
You not limited to just one thing.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
You got options. You can get you
a banana pudding cookie. Do you see that?

00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
First, vanilla wafers, white chocolate chip
and a vanilla icing.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
Then you have our famous banana pudding,
the thick one.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.000
Then you have the cone.

00:29.000 --> 00:32.000
The cone has banana pudding and cheesecake
with a white chocolate drizzle on the top.

00:32.000 --> 00:38.000
Which one you choosing? You got options.
You're never limited. We got options over here.
